OL,3,GNEWSACourier fraud warning after spate
OL,4,Aof incidents
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are warning people to be
OL,7,Fvigilant after fraudsters, one
OL,8,Fpurporting to be a police officer, have
OL,9,Fbeen pressuring victims into
OL,10,Fwithdrawing cash and to transfer
OL,11,F"significant amounts" of money to other
OL,12,Faccounts.
OL,14,FTwo elderly people in Herefordshire
OL,15,Fseparately encountered courier
OL,16,Ffraudsters who wanted them to hand over
OL,17,Fcash, buy high value items and transfer
OL,18,Fmoney to another bank account, West
OL,19,FMercia Police said.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
