OL,3,GNEWSACourier fraud warning after spate
OL,4,Aof incidents
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeveral incidents have been reported in
OL,7,FHerefordshire and Worcestershire in
OL,8,Frecent weeks, the force said, including
OL,9,Fa man pretending to be the chief police
OL,10,Fofficer in Hereford.
OL,12,FNo officer will ask someone to make a
OL,13,Fpayment or purchase, withdraw or
OL,14,Ftransfer money, the force said.
